{"task":"transcribe","language":"en","duration":66.3408125,"text":"Everyone's been asking me how they can install Jarvis, but Jarvis isn't just an app that you install. It's an entire operating system. Hey Jarvis, can you pull up that diagram of how you work? Of course, sir. Okay, cool. So this is basically how Agentec AI works. The reasoning core is the engine right here. That's where LLMs like Claude and ChatGBT do the thinking. And then Jarvis and all the specialist agents each have their own context and skills. So they know what they're responsible for and how to use the tools in their lane. The tools are what actually let them get things done. Access the Gmail, Instagram, meta ads, analytics, and a bunch of other tools that my business uses. And then the communication channels are how I talk to the system. Slack, iMessage, and Voice are all methods that I use to communicate with Jarvis. So Jarvis is really the central hub of a network. It connects LLMs to agents, to tools, to communication channels, which is what lets it do real work instead of just answering questions. So no, Jarvis is not something that you can just install. It's something that you build and train around your business.","words":null,"segments":[{"avg_logprob":-0.12166234812428875,"compression_ratio":1.6512345679012346,"end":2.72,"id":1,"no_speech_prob":0.004727809689939022,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"temperature":0.0,"text":" Everyone's been asking me how they can install Jarvis,","tokens":[50364,5198,311,668,3365,385,577,436,393,3625,23941,4938,11,50500],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.12166234812428875,"compression_ratio":1.6512345679012346,"end":4.7,"id":2,"no_speech_prob":0.004727809689939022,"seek":0,"start":2.72,"temperature":0.0,"text":" but Jarvis isn't just an app that you install.","tokens":[50500,457,23941,4938,1943,380,445,364,724,300,291,3625,13,50599],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.12166234812428875,"compression_ratio":1.6512345679012346,"end":7.08,"id":3,"no_speech_prob":0.004727809